<title>USA: Hempstead, N.Y. $81.7 mln bonds won by PaineWebber.</title>
<headline>Hempstead, N.Y. $81.7 mln bonds won by PaineWebber.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>PaineWebber Inc said Thursday it won $81.7 million Hempstead, N.Y., unlimited tax bonds at a true interest cost of 4.85 percent.</p>
